---
import SiteLayout from "../layouts/SiteLayout.astro";
---

<SiteLayout
  title="Privacy policy"
  description="Cambodia Bible Scripture app privacy policy."
  currentPath="/privacy/"
>
  <article class="content-section prose-section privacy-policy">
    <p class="eyebrow">Cambodia Bible</p>
    <h2>Scripture app privacy policy</h2>
    <p>
      Cambodia Bible produces and publishes Scripture apps for minority
      languages of Cambodia. This policy explains what information may be
      collected when you use a Scripture app and how it may be used.
    </p>

    <h3>Device access</h3>
    <p>
      Scripture apps may need permission to read and write to your device's
      storage, including memory cards. This allows audio Scripture downloads to
      be saved and played on your device. You can choose whether to grant this
      permission.
    </p>

    <h3>Information that may be collected</h3>
    <p>
      A Scripture app may collect non-personally identifiable information such
      as device type, operating system version, approximate city or country,
      and the books read. If analytics is enabled and the device is online, the
      app may periodically send usage information to Google Analytics.
    </p>
    <p>
      Scripture apps do not collect personally identifiable information. If a
      device does not connect to the internet, analytics data is not collected.
    </p>

    <h3>How information is used and protected</h3>
    <p>
      Information may be used to understand how many people use the apps and
      where they are used, and to improve support for users. Appropriate
      security measures are used to protect against unauthorized access,
      alteration, disclosure, or destruction of data.
    </p>

    <h3>Sharing information</h3>
    <p>
      Cambodia Bible does not sell, trade, or otherwise transfer collected data
      to outside parties. Trusted service providers may assist in operating
      the apps or conducting business, provided they agree to keep information
      confidential.
    </p>

    <h3>Your consent and policy changes</h3>
    <p>By using Scripture apps, you consent to this privacy policy.</p>
    <p>
      Changes to this policy will be posted on this page. This policy was last
      updated on September 17, 2025.
    </p>

    <h3>Contact</h3>
    <p>
      If you have questions about this privacy policy, contact
      <a href="mailto:cambodiabible@gmail.com">cambodiabible@gmail.com</a>.
    </p>
  </article>
</SiteLayout>
